{"id":"eedfed81ed59c040","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-cof-complete-pair.md","title":"Σ₃ 肯定余有限、否定 Turing 完全的统一编码","display":"thm-cof-complete-pair — Σ₃ 肯定余有限、否定 Turing 完全的统一编码","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-cof-complete-pair","aliases":["20-thm-cof-complete-pair"],"display":"thm-cof-complete-pair — Σ₃ 肯定余有限、否定 Turing 完全的统一编码","chapter":"4","section":"4.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 4.3.5","source_printed_pages":[88,89],"source_pdf_pages":[124,125],"depends_on":["[[20-df-arith]]","[[20-df-complete-ce-index]]","[[20-df-cof]]","[[20-df-rec-index]]","[[20-df-movable-markers]]","[[20-thm-inf-complexity]]","[[20-thm-K-one-complete]]","[[20-thm-K-undecidable]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-lem-padding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-cof-complete-pair"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-cof-complete-pair</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cof-complete-pair — Σ₃ 肯定余有限、否定 Turing 完全的统一编码"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 4.3.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88</span><span>89</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>124</span><span>125</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"832f53dc90c8947a\" href=\"?note=832f53dc90c8947a\" title=\"20-df-arith\">20-df-arith</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"eceb04fc9b8231ff\" href=\"?note=eceb04fc9b8231ff\" title=\"20-df-complete-ce-index\">20-df-complete-ce-index</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ddc81bc510c82f3e\" href=\"?note=ddc81bc510c82f3e\" title=\"20-df-cof\">20-df-cof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"481242259f6605e4\" href=\"?note=481242259f6605e4\" title=\"20-df-rec-index\">20-df-rec-index</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" href=\"?note=466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" title=\"20-df-movable-markers\">20-df-movable-markers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"14c630355ef04ac5\" href=\"?note=14c630355ef04ac5\" title=\"20-thm-inf-complexity\">20-thm-inf-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d18ba716e49ac8c6\" href=\"?note=d18ba716e49ac8c6\" title=\"20-thm-K-undecidable\">20-thm-K-undecidable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\Sigma_3^0\">\\(P\\in\\Sigma_3^0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_s\">\\(K_s\\)</span> 是递增有限枚举。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cof}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cof}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cpl}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cpl}\\)</span> 分别为余有限、可计算及 Turing 完全 c.e. 集的指标集合。构造的域集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_x=W_{f(x)}\">\\(B_x=W_{f(x)}\\)</span> 使用标记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_y^x(s)\">\\(b_y^x(s)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"832f53dc90c8947a\" href=\"?note=832f53dc90c8947a\" title=\"20-df-arith\">20-df-arith</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"eceb04fc9b8231ff\" href=\"?note=eceb04fc9b8231ff\" title=\"20-df-complete-ce-index\">20-df-complete-ce-index</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"ddc81bc510c82f3e\" href=\"?note=ddc81bc510c82f3e\" title=\"20-df-cof\">20-df-cof</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"481242259f6605e4\" href=\"?note=481242259f6605e4\" title=\"20-df-rec-index\">20-df-rec-index</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" href=\"?note=466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" title=\"20-df-movable-markers\">20-df-movable-markers</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"14c630355ef04ac5\" href=\"?note=14c630355ef04ac5\" title=\"20-thm-inf-complexity\">20-thm-inf-complexity</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"d18ba716e49ac8c6\" href=\"?note=d18ba716e49ac8c6\" title=\"20-thm-K-undecidable\">20-thm-K-undecidable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cof-complete-pair}\\vdash\n\\exists f:\\omega\\to\\omega\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\nf\\text{ 全可计算且单射},\\\\\n\\forall x\\ (x\\in P\\Rightarrow f(x)\\in\\mathrm{Cof}\\cap\\mathrm{Rec}),\\\\\n\\forall x\\ (x\\notin P\\Rightarrow f(x)\\in\\mathrm{Cpl}\\setminus\\mathrm{Rec})\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cof-complete-pair}\\vdash\n\\exists f:\\omega\\to\\omega\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\nf\\text{ 全可计算且单射},\\\\\n\\forall x\\ (x\\in P\\Rightarrow f(x)\\in\\mathrm{Cof}\\cap\\mathrm{Rec}),\\\\\n\\forall x\\ (x\\notin P\\Rightarrow f(x)\\in\\mathrm{Cpl}\\setminus\\mathrm{Rec})\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>如 Cof 构造，取统一踢集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_y^x\">\\(V_y^x\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in P\\iff\\exists y\\ |V_y^x|=\\omega\">\\(x\\in P\\iff\\exists y\\ |V_y^x|=\\omega\\)</span>。置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_0=\\varnothing\">\\(B_0=\\varnothing\\)</span>。阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+1\">\\(s+1\\)</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\le s\">\\(y\\le s\\)</span>，若踢集在本阶段有新成员，或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in K_{s+1}\">\\(y\\in K_{s+1}\\)</span> 尚未执行 K 编码，则把阶段开始时的补集标记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_y(s)\">\\(b_y(s)\\)</span> 枚举入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>；第二种条件同时记入已编码的有限标志表，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 至多一次。每个阶段只处理有限个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>，所有补集标记由有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_s\">\\(B_s\\)</span> 计算。此形式也覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 在激活之前已入 K 的阶段约定，避免漏记早入元素。</p>\n<p>肯定情形仍有一个标记被无穷踢，补集有限，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_x\">\\(B_x\\)</span> 余有限且可计算。否定情形所有踢集有限，加上每个 K 动作至多一次，按低位归纳使所有标记稳定，补集无限。给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_x\">\\(B_x\\)</span> oracle，可逐个找其补集的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 个最终数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_y\">\\(b_y\\)</span>；模拟阶段直到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\ge y+1\">\\(s\\ge y+1\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_y(s)=b_y\">\\(b_y(s)=b_y\\)</span>。标记单调且已等于真实第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 个补集数，此后不能再动。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 以后才入 K，未执行的编码动作会删去 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_y\">\\(b_y\\)</span>，矛盾。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in K\\iff y\\in K_s\">\\(y\\in K\\iff y\\in K_s\\)</span>，给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\le_TB_x\">\\(K\\le_TB_x\\)</span>。反向 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_x\">\\(B_x\\)</span> c.e. 给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_x\\le_TK\">\\(B_x\\le_TK\\)</span>，于是 Turing 完全且非可计算。</p>\n<p>全部动作统一于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，s-m-n 和 padding 得单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>。证明同时给两种二列编码；并未把 Cpl 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_3\">\\(\\Pi_3\\)</span>-困难性误写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_3\">\\(\\Pi_3\\)</span>-完全性。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 88–89 / PDF 124–125。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-arith","status":"resolved","id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-arith]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-complete-ce-index","status":"resolved","id":"eceb04fc9b8231ff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-complete-ce-index]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cof","status":"resolved","id":"ddc81bc510c82f3e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cof]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-rec-index","status":"resolved","id":"481242259f6605e4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-rec-index]]","e